{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_201_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_201","textTraditional":"一、二十年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_201_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_201","textTraditional":"二、夏，曹公孫會自夢出奔宋。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_201_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_201","textTraditional":"自夢者，專乎夢也。曹無大夫，其曰公孫何也？言其以貴取之，而不以叛也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_201_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_201","textTraditional":"三、秋，盜殺衞侯之兄輒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_201_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_201","textTraditional":"盜，賤也。其曰兄，母兄也。目衞侯，衞侯累也。然則何為不為君也？有天疾者，不得入乎宗廟。輒者何也？曰「兩足不能相過」，齊謂之綦，楚謂之踂，衞謂之輒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_201_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_201","textTraditional":"四、冬，十月，宋華亥、向寧、華定出奔陳。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_201_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_201","textTraditional":"五、十有一月，辛卯，蔡侯廬卒。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}